following withdrawal methods are currently supported: bank-to-securities withdrawals, API direct payments (including FPS, CHATS, SWIFT, and intra-bank transfers), and batch online banking transfers.","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"doxjpmZz5Yx8zL6T3r4bToZql3c","block_type":19,"callout":{"background_color":5,"border_color":5,"emoji_id":"round_pushpin","text_color":1},"children":["doxjpDR748lWb14bQG98JN1DHtg"],"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf"},{"block_id":"doxjpDR748lWb14bQG98JN1DHtg","block_type":2,"parent_id":"doxjpmZz5Yx8zL6T3r4bToZql3c","text":{"elements":[{"text_run":{"content":"Q: ","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}},{"text_run":{"content":"What are the common causes of withdrawal exception records?","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"doxjpXfqhxPcPOUBdgD3j6mT2ke","block_type":2,"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf","text":{"elements":[{"text_run":{"content":"A: ","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}},{"text_run":{"content":"Withdrawal exception records typically arise from one of two situations: a discrepancy between the system's withdrawal records and the bank's transaction statements, or a withdrawal being rejected by the bank. Common causes include the use of an unsupported deposit or withdrawal method, or the triggering of Anti-Money Laundering (AML) rules. For the specific reason, please contact the bank.","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"doxjp56zpRIEEhoGsGWocZhinxe","block_type":19,"callout":{"background_color":5,"border_color":5,"emoji_id":"round_pushpin","text_color":1},"children":["doxjp9ia9Opfo0D6ZiGuMbrKvNb"],"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf"},{"block_id":"doxjp9ia9Opfo0D6ZiGuMbrKvNb","block_type":2,"parent_id":"doxjp56zpRIEEhoGsGWocZhinxe","text":{"elements":[{"text_run":{"content":"Q: Why do some withdrawals not require manual status updates?","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"doxjpW3Rqm5YnT25pz3lpQ2qh6d","block_type":2,"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf","text":{"elements":[{"text_run":{"content":"A: ","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}},{"text_run":{"content":"Certain withdrawal methods are processed through API-integrated channels, which automate both approval and disbursement. For these methods, the system executes the entire withdrawal process automatically without any manual intervention.","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"doxjpsp03syZG9FH04ay0zTOISc","block_type":19,"callout":{"background_color":5,"border_color":5,"emoji_id":"round_pushpin","text_color":1},"children":["doxjpq2wFgsO9x4p0TwBDFEDGdh"],"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf"},{"block_id":"doxjpq2wFgsO9x4p0TwBDFEDGdh","block_type":2,"parent_id":"doxjpsp03syZG9FH04ay0zTOISc","text":{"elements":[{"text_run":{"content":"Q: ","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}},{"text_run":{"content":"Can I configure withdrawal rules to replace manual operations?","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"doxjpHj7vfV23LonIPSfTGNx4be","block_type":2,"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf","text":{"elements":[{"text_run":{"content":"A: Yes. ","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}},{"text_run":{"content":"To set up withdrawal rules, navigate to Service Parameter > Withdrawal Rules Management > Withdrawal Rules and click Add. Complete the required fields in the pop-up window and confirm. You can also click Edit or Delete to modify or remove an existing rule if needed.","text_element_style":{"bold":false,"inline_code":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false}}}],"style":{"align":1,"folded":false}}},{"block_id":"O1ZgdoFYkovph8xN8SLjn1FDpRf","block_type":27,"image":{"align":2,"height":2886,"scale":1,"token":"FSg1bKmJxo2yFXxXCHnj99HUphf","width":2452},"parent_id":"HlbvdCS3qoE3qVx3dQ9jIuULpOf"}]}